<title>USA: TENNIS-AT&amp;T CHALLENGE QUARTER-FINAL RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-AT&amp;T CHALLENGE QUARTER-FINAL RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results from the $328,000 AT&amp;T</p>
<p>Challenge men's tennis tournament on Friday (prefix number</p>
<p>denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Quarter-finals</p>
<p>Magnus Norman (Sweden) beat 5-Petr Korda (Czech Republic) 6-4</p>
<p>6-4</p>
<p>7-Jason Stoltenberg (Australia) beat Fernando Meligeni</p>
<p>(Brazil) 3-1 retired (hip injury)</p>
<p>8-Chris Woodruff (U.S.) beat Sandon Stolle (Australia) 6-1</p>
<p>4-6 6-3</p>
<p>Marcelo Filippini (Uruguay) beat Gilbert Schaller (Austria)</p>
<p>6-1 6-2</p>
</text>
